# Turtles Forever searches for stated qualities (CR 701.23b), so Bot1 need not find all four: with Lutri and Isamaru in the library
# and Lurrus outside the game, four with different names exist (Kaheera also outside), but Bot1 finds only Lutri and Lurrus.
# Both go to Bot1's hand with no choice to make (an opponent chooses two of two), nothing is left to shuffle in, and the library is shuffled all the same.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Turtles Forever
Plains
Plains
Plains
Plains
Lutri, the Spellchaser
Isamaru, Hound of Konda
Plains x11

[Bot1 Sideboard]
Lurrus of the Dream-Den
Kaheera, the Orphanguard

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Turtles Forever.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Lutri, the Spellchaser; Lurrus of the Dream-Den)

[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Lurrus of the Dream-Den; Lutri, the Spellchaser; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains
Bot1.Library.Count = 12
Bot1.Library != Isamaru, Hound of Konda; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains
Bot1.Sideboard = Kaheera, the Orphanguard
